-- Demo seed (US-16): applied only with the demo profile via
-- spring.flyway.locations. Deterministic refuels over the last 88 days for the
-- 25 vehicles of ms-vehicles (V2__demo_vehicles.sql), so the fuel dataset is
-- coherent with the rest of the demo: vehicle_id, fuel_type and tank capacity
-- come from that same seed and consumption_l100km follows the service formula
-- (liters between full tanks / km between full tanks) x 100.
-- Two IN_USE vans (2766MQT, 2803RWZ) burn ~30% more during the last 30 days so
-- ms-alerts raises HIGH_CONSUMPTION on the first evaluation.
